# Archetype smoke-test screenshots
/zerozstack-archetype/smoke/shots/

# What running the archetype smoke test leaves in its own directory. All three are made by the
# steps in zerozstack-archetype/smoke/README.md, and none of them belongs in the repository:
# the browser driver it needs, the throwaway application it generates, and the private Maven
# repository that application is built into so the throwaway artifacts never reach the shared one.
/zerozstack-archetype/smoke/node_modules/
/zerozstack-archetype/smoke/smokeapp/
/zerozstack-archetype/smoke/.m2smoke/

# Private Maven repository head used by worker sessions (see AGENTS.md)
.m2head/
